        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Problem:To determine if spalling of a concrete wall occurs if there is no perforation by the primary fragment.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                325,
                972,
                377
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Procedure:",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                398,
                263,
                418
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 1.Determine the type, weight $W_{f}$ and striking velocity $v_{s}$ of the primary fragment. Also, the thickness of the concrete wall and the ultimate compressive stress of the concrete $f_{c}$ must be known.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                441,
                975,
                519
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 2.Proceed through Steps 2, 3, 4, and 5 of Problem $4A{-}10$ ",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                538,
                856,
                563
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 3.If embedment of the fragment occurs, compute the limiting concrete thickness at which spalling will occur according to:",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                582,
                978,
                634
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "formula",
            "block_content": "T_{s o}=1.215X_{f}d^{0.1}+2.12d 一\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                345,
                651,
                629,
                677
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If $T_{s p}$ is greater than $T_{c},$  spalling will occur.",
